`cpanfile` requires `LWP::UserAgent` only. Every real issuer is an `https://` URL (SYNOPSIS, README), and without `LWP::Protocol::https` a fresh install fails at the first request with `Protocol scheme 'https' is not supported`. The sibling `p5-www-authentik/cpanfile` declares it.

Done: `requires 'LWP::Protocol::https';` in `cpanfile`, Changes line.

